  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pxx7](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pxx7) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 56.116 depth occurred on May 08 2025 8km NE of Casitas. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -3.8565 longitude -80.616. It impacted 150374 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
